2f:["$","$27",null,{"fallback":["$","p",null,{"className":"text-slate-500","children":"Loading products…"}],"children":["$","$L31",null,{"products":[{"name":"Halloween Banner – Happy Halloween Cloth","slug":"halloween-banner-happy-halloween-cloth","description":"Welcome guests in spooky style with the Halloween Banner – Happy Halloween Cloth. Featuring a festive &#8220;Happy Halloween&#8221; message and eye-catching seasonal designs, this reusable cloth banner is perfect for Halloween parties, haunted houses, classrooms, offices, photo booths, and home decorations. Made from durable fabric material, the banner is lightweight, easy to hang, and suitable for both indoor and outdoor use. The vibrant Halloween-themed design adds a fun and festive atmosphere to walls, doorways, porches, party backdrops, and event spaces. Perfect for Halloween celebrations, trick-or-treat events, school functions, and seasonal gatherings, this decorative banner creates an impressive focal point while pairing beautifully with balloons, pumpkins, spider webs, and other spooky decorations.","price":5.99,"compareAtPrice":8,"currency":"USD","categorySlug":"home-decoration","images":["https://halloweenready.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Halloween-Enamel-Pin-Set-–-5-Pins-1.png"],"inventory":200,"tags":["Cloth Halloween Banner","Halloween Banner","Halloween Party Decorations","Happy Halloween Banner"],"seoTitle":"Halloween Banner – Happy Halloween Cloth","seoDescription":"Welcome guests in spooky style with the Halloween Banner – Happy Halloween Cloth."},{"name":"Pumpkin Luminary Paper Bags – 12 Pack","slug":"pumpkin-luminary-paper-bags-12-pack","description":"Light up your Halloween celebrations with the Pumpkin Luminary Paper Bags – 12 Pack. These festive paper luminary bags feature spooky pumpkin-themed designs that create a warm and glowing Halloween atmosphere for parties, pathways, gardens, patios, and haunted house setups. Simply place LED candles or lights inside to create beautiful illuminated decorations for nighttime celebrations. Perfect for lining walkways, driveways, staircases, entrances, balconies, and party areas, these pumpkin luminary bags instantly add a magical spooky touch to your décor. Their classic Halloween pumpkin print makes them ideal for trick-or-treat nights, horror-themed events, cafés, shops, and festive gatherings.","price":5.99,"compareAtPrice":8.66,"currency":"USD","categorySlug":"home-decoration","images":["https://halloweenready.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Untitled-design-15-10.png"],"inventory":200,"tags":["Halloween Decoration","Halloween Paper Bags","Pumpkin Luminary Bags"],"seoTitle":"Pumpkin Luminary Paper Bags – 12 Pack","seoDescription":"Light up your Halloween celebrations with the Pumpkin Luminary Paper Bags – 12 Pack."},{"name":"Black Crow/Raven Prop – Set of 2","slug":"black-crow-raven-prop-set-of-2","description":"Add a creepy haunted touch to your Halloween décor with the Black Crow/Raven Prop – Set of 2. These realistic black bird props are perfect for creating spooky scenes in haunted houses, Halloween parties, gothic décor setups, and horror-themed events. Designed with detailed feathers and lifelike appearance, these raven decorations instantly enhance the eerie atmosphere of any space. Perfect for placing on walls, trees, fences, tables, shelves, pumpkins, tombstones, or party backdrops, these lightweight crow props are easy to position and reusable for multiple Halloween celebrations. Their classic black gothic style pairs perfectly with skeletons, cobwebs, candles","price":9.99,"compareAtPrice":12.34,"currency":"USD","categorySlug":"home-decoration","images":["https://halloweenready.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Untitled-design-15-9.png"],"inventory":200,"tags":["Black Raven Prop","Crow Halloween Decoration","Raven Halloween Decor"],"seoTitle":"Black Crow/Raven Prop – Set of 2","seoDescription":"Add a creepy haunted touch to your Halloween décor with the Black Crow/Raven Prop – Set of 2."},{"name":"Orange & Black Balloon Pack – 50pcs","slug":"orange-black-balloon-pack-50pcs","description":"Decorate your Halloween party in style with the Orange & Black Balloon Pack – 50pcs. This festive balloon set includes 50 premium latex balloons in classic Halloween colors, orange and black, perfect for creating spooky party decorations, balloon arches, photo booth backdrops, and haunted house setups. Each balloon measures 12 inches, making them ideal for indoor and outdoor celebrations. Use them to decorate walls, ceilings, entrances, dessert tables, event stages, or party venues for a fun and spooky Halloween atmosphere. The vibrant color combination perfectly matches Halloween themes, horror parties, and festive décor setups. Made from durable latex material, these balloons are lightweight, easy to inflate, and suitable for helium or air filling. Perfect for Halloween parties, birthdays, school events, cafés, shops, and horror-themed celebrations, this balloon pack instantly adds excitement and festive charm to any space.","price":7.99,"compareAtPrice":10,"currency":"USD","categorySlug":"home-decoration","images":["https://halloweenready.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Orange-Black-Balloon-Pack-–-50pcs-1.png","https://halloweenready.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Orange-Black-Balloon-Pack-–-50pcs-2.png"],"inventory":200,"tags":["Halloween Balloons","Halloween Party Decoration","Orange Black Balloons"],"seoTitle":"Orange & Black Balloon Pack – 50pcs","seoDescription":"Decorate your Halloween party in style with the Orange & Black Balloon Pack – 50pcs."},{"name":"Fake Cobweb Roll – Large Pack 50g","slug":"fake-cobweb-roll-large-pack-50g","description":"Create a creepy haunted atmosphere with the Fake Cobweb Roll – Large Pack 50g. Made from stretchy cotton-style material, this fake spider web decoration is perfect for transforming homes, haunted houses, party venues, and Halloween setups into spooky horror scenes. The lightweight webbing can be stretched across walls, ceilings, furniture, windows, staircases, trees, and party backdrops for a realistic cobweb effect. This large 50g pack provides wide coverage, making it ideal for decorating indoor and outdoor spaces with ease. Pair it with plastic spiders, skeletons, pumpkins, and other Halloween props to create an even more terrifying display. Reusable and easy to apply, this fake cobweb decoration is perfect for Halloween parties, horror-themed events, spooky photo booths, cafés, shops, and festive home décor. It instantly adds a creepy and realistic haunted touch to any space.","price":3.28,"compareAtPrice":5,"currency":"USD","categorySlug":"home-decoration","images":["https://halloweenready.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/fake-cow-bell-roll.png"],"inventory":200,"tags":["Fake Cobweb Decoration","Fake Cobweb Roll – Large Pack 50g","Fake Spider Web","Halloween Spider Web"],"seoTitle":"Fake Cobweb Roll – Large Pack 50g","seoDescription":"Create a creepy haunted atmosphere with the Fake Cobweb Roll – Large Pack 50g."},{"name":"Spooky Welcome Door Sign – Wooden/MDF","slug":"spooky-welcome-door-sign-wooden-mdf","description":"Welcome guests with spooky festive vibes using the Spooky Welcome Door Sign – Wooden/MDF. This handcrafted Halloween door sign features beautifully painted spooky designs, making it a perfect decorative piece for front doors, walls, entryways, haunted houses, and Halloween party setups. Crafted from durable wood or MDF material, this stylish hanging sign adds a rustic and creepy charm to your home décor. The eye-catching Halloween artwork and festive “Welcome” theme make it ideal for greeting trick-or-treaters and party guests with a spooky touch. Lightweight and easy to hang, this reusable decoration is perfect for homes, cafés, shops, classrooms, and horror-themed events. Whether displayed indoors or outdoors, this handcrafted Halloween sign instantly enhances the festive atmosphere with a fun and spooky appearance.","price":11.99,"compareAtPrice":15,"currency":"USD","categorySlug":"home-decoration","images":["https://halloweenready.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Untitled-design-15-8.png","https://halloweenready.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Untitled-design-16.png","https://halloweenready.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/imgi_90_81qZw8w9ltL._SL1500_.png"],"inventory":200,"tags":["Halloween Door Sign","Spooky Welcome Sign","Wooden Halloween Decor"],"seoTitle":"Spooky Welcome Door Sign – Wooden/MDF","seoDescription":"Welcome guests with spooky festive vibes using the Spooky Welcome Door Sign – Wooden/MDF."},{"name":"Halloween Doormat – Skull/Pumpkin Design","slug":"halloween-doormat-skull-pumpkin-design","description":"Welcome guests with spooky Halloween vibes using the Halloween Doormat – Skull/Pumpkin Design. Featuring eye-catching skull and pumpkin-themed prints, this decorative doormat is perfect for adding a festive horror touch to your entrance, doorway, patio, or party setup. Made from durable non-slip coir or rubber material, this Halloween doormat helps keep dirt away while providing a secure grip on indoor and outdoor surfaces. The creepy yet stylish design makes it ideal for haunted houses, Halloween parties, horror-themed décor, cafés, shops, and festive home entrances. Lightweight, easy to clean, and reusable, this Halloween entrance mat is a perfect combination of functionality and spooky decoration. Whether placed at your front door, balcony, hallway, or event entrance, it instantly creates a welcoming Halloween atmosphere.","price":17.99,"compareAtPrice":25,"currency":"USD","categorySlug":"home-decoration","images":["https://halloweenready.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Halloween-Doormat.png","https://halloweenready.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/imgi_69_61qWZLjar7L._SL1500_.png","https://halloweenready.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/imgi_92_6167tbhTtXL._SL1500_.png"],"inventory":200,"tags":["Halloween Doormat","Halloween Entrance Mat","Skull Pumpkin Doormat"],"seoTitle":"Halloween Doormat – Skull/Pumpkin Design","seoDescription":"Welcome guests with spooky Halloween vibes using the Halloween Doormat – Skull/Pumpkin Design."},{"name":"Black Lace Table Runner – 72 inch","slug":"black-lace-table-runner-72-inch","description":"The Black Lace Table Runner – 72 Inch. Featuring a beautiful gothic lace design, this decorative table runner is perfect for Halloween parties, horror-themed dinners, haunted house décor, and festive table arrangements. Its stylish black lace pattern creates a mysterious and classy atmosphere while enhancing your dining or party table décor. Made from lightweight and durable fabric, this 72-inch table runner is ideal for dining tables, buffet tables, coffee tables, dessert counters, and party setups. The intricate lace detailing pairs perfectly with candles, pumpkins, skulls, and other Halloween decorations to create a stunning gothic-inspired display.","price":7.99,"compareAtPrice":10.99,"currency":"USD","categorySlug":"home-decoration","images":["https://halloweenready.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/table-rubber.png"],"inventory":200,"tags":["Black Lace Table Runner","Gothic Table Runner","Halloween Table Décor"],"seoTitle":"Black Lace Table Runner – 72 inch","seoDescription":"The Black Lace Table Runner – 72 Inch. Featuring a beautiful gothic lace design, this decorative table runner is perfect for Halloween parties,…"},{"name":"Glowing Eyes Outdoor Stakes – Set of 6","slug":"glowing-eyes-outdoor-stakes-set-of-6","description":"Make your outdoor Halloween décor extra creepy with the Glowing Eyes Outdoor Stakes – Set of 6. These spooky glowing eye decorations are designed to create the illusion of mysterious creatures hiding in the dark, making them perfect for lawns, gardens, pathways, haunted houses, and Halloween party setups. Each glowing eye stake is easy to place into the ground and instantly adds a chilling atmosphere to your outdoor space. Ideal for nighttime Halloween displays, these eerie glowing eyes look terrifying among bushes, trees, flower beds, or walkways, creating a realistic haunted effect for trick-or-treaters and guests. Made from durable and lightweight materials, these reusable outdoor decorations are suitable for Halloween parties, horror-themed events, yard décor, and spooky photo setups.","price":16.99,"compareAtPrice":20.45,"currency":"USD","categorySlug":"home-decoration","images":["https://halloweenready.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/glowing-eyes.png"],"inventory":200,"tags":["Glowing Eyes Decoration","Halloween Yard Stakes","Outdoor Halloween Décor"],"seoTitle":"Glowing Eyes Outdoor Stakes – Set of 6","seoDescription":"Make your outdoor Halloween décor extra creepy with the Glowing Eyes Outdoor Stakes – Set of 6."},{"name":"Animated Window Projector – Ghost/Zombie","slug":"animated-window-projector-ghost-zombie","description":"Bring your Halloween decorations to life with the Animated Window Projector – Ghost/Zombie. This spooky projector creates terrifying ghost and zombie animations on windows, walls, or flat surfaces, turning your home into a haunted attraction instantly. Perfect for Halloween parties, horror-themed events, haunted houses, cafés, shops, and festive displays, it delivers a realistic creepy visual effect that grabs everyone’s attention. The projector is easy to set up and ideal for both indoor and outdoor use during nighttime celebrations. Simply place it near a window or projection surface to display scary moving ghost and zombie scenes that create a chilling Halloween atmosphere.","price":36.99,"compareAtPrice":40.34,"currency":"USD","categorySlug":"home-decoration","images":["https://halloweenready.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Untitled-design-15-7.png"],"inventory":200,"tags":["Ghost Projector","Halloween Projector","Zombie Projector"],"seoTitle":"Animated Window Projector – Ghost/Zombie","seoDescription":"Bring your Halloween decorations to life with the Animated Window Projector – Ghost/Zombie."},{"name":"Tombstone Yard Stakes – Set of 4","slug":"tombstone-yard-stakes-set-of-4","description":"Create a realistic haunted graveyard setup with the Tombstone Yard Stakes – Set of 4. These spooky Halloween tombstone decorations are designed to transform your lawn, garden, pathway, or party area into a creepy cemetery scene. Featuring classic graveyard-style designs with horror-themed detailing, these tombstone props are perfect for Halloween parties, haunted houses, outdoor décor, and spooky events. Made from lightweight yet durable material, each tombstone comes with yard stakes for easy installation in gardens, lawns, or outdoor spaces. They can also be used indoors for haunted setups, stage decorations, photo booths, and horror-themed displays.","price":15.99,"compareAtPrice":19.78,"currency":"USD","categorySlug":"home-decoration","images":["https://halloweenready.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/tombstone.png"],"inventory":200,"tags":["Creepy Tombstones","Halloween Lawn Décor","Scary Party Decoration"],"seoTitle":"Tombstone Yard Stakes – Set of 4","seoDescription":"Create a realistic haunted graveyard setup with the Tombstone Yard Stakes – Set of 4."},{"name":"Cauldron Prop – Black Plastic Medium","slug":"cauldron-prop-black-plastic-medium","description":"Add a magical spooky touch to your Halloween décor with the Cauldron Prop – Black Plastic Medium. Designed in a classic witch’s pot style, this black plastic cauldron is perfect for Halloween parties, candy collection, haunted house setups, cosplay accessories, and horror-themed decorations. Made from lightweight and durable plastic, this medium-sized cauldron is easy to carry, reusable, and ideal for both decorative and practical use. Use it as a candy bowl, party prop, table centerpiece, or costume accessory to create an authentic witch-themed atmosphere.","price":12.99,"compareAtPrice":16.23,"currency":"USD","categorySlug":"home-decoration","images":["https://halloweenready.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Untitled-design-15-6.png"],"inventory":200,"tags":["Black Plastic Cauldron","Halloween Cauldron","Witch Cauldron"],"seoTitle":"Cauldron Prop – Black Plastic Medium","seoDescription":"Add a magical spooky touch to your Halloween décor with the Cauldron Prop – Black Plastic Medium."},{"name":"Witch Hat – Adult Black Felt","slug":"witch-hat-adult-black-felt","description":"Complete your spooky Halloween look with the Witch Hat – Adult Black Felt. Designed with a classic pointed witch style, this elegant black felt hat is the perfect accessory for Halloween parties, cosplay events, costume themes, stage performances, and festive celebrations. Made from lightweight and comfortable felt material, the hat provides a stylish yet spooky appearance suitable for adults. Its wide brim and tall pointed design create the iconic witch look, making it ideal for witches, wizards, gothic costumes, and horror-themed outfits.","price":7.99,"compareAtPrice":11,"currency":"USD","categorySlug":"home-decoration","images":["https://halloweenready.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Untitled-design-15-5.png"],"inventory":200,"tags":["Black Felt Hat","Halloween Costume Accessory","Halloween Witch Hat","Witch Hat"],"seoTitle":"Witch Hat – Adult Black Felt","seoDescription":"Complete your spooky Halloween look with the Witch Hat – Adult Black Felt."},{"name":"Ghost Hanging Decorations – Set of 3","slug":"ghost-hanging-decorations-set-of-3","description":"Create a chilling Halloween atmosphere with the Ghost Hanging Decorations – Set of 3. This spooky decoration set includes three floating ghost figures designed to add a creepy and fun touch to your Halloween party, haunted house, or horror-themed setup. With their flowing fabric design and scary ghost appearance, these hanging decorations instantly make any space look festive and haunted. Perfect for hanging on ceilings, doorways, balconies, trees, windows, walls, or party backdrops, these lightweight ghost decorations are easy to install and reusable for multiple Halloween celebrations. Ideal for homes, cafés, shops, schools, events, and spooky photo booths, they bring the perfect ghostly vibe to indoor and outdoor décor. Made from durable materials with eye-catching detailing, these ghost hanging props are a must-have for anyone looking to create a memorable Halloween setup.","price":5.99,"compareAtPrice":8.56,"currency":"USD","categorySlug":"home-decoration","images":["https://halloweenready.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Untitled-design-15-4.png"],"inventory":200,"tags":["Halloween Props","Horror Theme Decoration","Scary Party Decor"],"seoTitle":"Ghost Hanging Decorations – Set of 3","seoDescription":"Create a chilling Halloween atmosphere with the Ghost Hanging Decorations – Set of 3."},{"name":"Skull LED Tea Light Candles – Set of 6","slug":"skull-led-tea-light-candles-set-of-6","description":"Add a spooky glow to your Halloween décor with the Skull LED Tea Light Candles – Set of 6. These creepy skull-shaped LED candles create the perfect horror atmosphere for Halloween parties, haunted houses, table décor, and festive decorations. Designed with realistic skull detailing and flickering LED lights, they provide a scary candlelight effect without the mess or danger of real flames. Battery-operated and lightweight, these LED tea light candles are easy to place on tables, shelves, party setups, windows, staircases, and spooky displays. Perfect for indoor Halloween décor, horror-themed events, cafés, shops, and photo booth decorations, they instantly enhance the eerie ambiance of any space. Reusable and safe for long-term use, this set of 6 skull LED candles is an ideal decoration accessory for creating a haunted Halloween vibe.","price":13.99,"compareAtPrice":17.87,"currency":"USD","categorySlug":"home-decoration","images":["https://halloweenready.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Untitled-design-15-3.png"],"inventory":200,"tags":["Halloween Tea Lights","Skull Candle Decoration","Skull LED Candles"],"seoTitle":"Skull LED Tea Light Candles – Set of 6","seoDescription":"Add a spooky glow to your Halloween décor with the Skull LED Tea Light Candles – Set of 6."},{"name":"Pumpkin String Lights – LED Battery (10ft)","slug":"pumpkin-string-lights-led-battery-10ft","description":"Light up your Halloween celebrations with the Pumpkin String Lights – LED Battery (10ft). Featuring glowing pumpkin-shaped LED lights on a 10ft string, this decorative lighting adds a warm and spooky ambiance to Halloween parties, haunted houses, bedrooms, cafés, balconies, and festive setups. Powered by batteries for convenient cordless use, these LED pumpkin lights can be easily hung on walls, windows, doors, staircases, party backdrops, trees, or tabletops. The bright pumpkin design creates the perfect Halloween atmosphere for both indoor and outdoor decorations. Made with energy-efficient LED lights and durable materials, this reusable decoration is lightweight, portable, and easy to install, making it a perfect choice for Halloween parties, horror-themed events, and festive décor lovers.","price":10.99,"compareAtPrice":13.44,"currency":"USD","categorySlug":"home-decoration","images":["https://halloweenready.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Untitled-design-15-2.png"],"inventory":200,"tags":["Halloween LED Lights","Pumpkin Decoration Lights","Pumpkin String Lights"],"seoTitle":"Pumpkin String Lights – LED Battery (10ft)","seoDescription":"Light up your Halloween celebrations with the Pumpkin String Lights – LED Battery (10ft)."},{"name":"Spider Web Deco + Plastic Spiders (Large Pack)","slug":"spider-web-deco-plastic-spiders-large-pack","description":"Transform your space into a spooky haunted setup with the Spider Web Deco + Plastic Spiders (Large Pack). This Halloween decoration set includes stretchable artificial spider web material along with realistic plastic spiders to create a terrifying horror atmosphere for parties, haunted houses, and festive décor. The web is easy to stretch and shape across walls, ceilings, furniture, windows, doors, staircases, and outdoor spaces, while the creepy spiders add the perfect scary touch. Ideal for Halloween parties, horror-themed events, photo booths, cafés, shops, and home decoration, this reusable decoration pack instantly enhances the spooky vibe of any area. Made from lightweight and durable material, the spider web décor is simple to install and remove, making it a must-have Halloween party decoration for indoor and outdoor use.","price":3.76,"compareAtPrice":5.98,"currency":"USD","categorySlug":"home-decoration","images":["https://halloweenready.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Untitled-design-15-1.png"],"inventory":200,"tags":["Halloween Spider Web","Plastic Spiders","Spider Web Decoration"],"seoTitle":"Spider Web Deco + Plastic Spiders (Large Pack)","seoDescription":"Transform your space into a spooky haunted setup with the Spider Web Deco + Plastic Spiders (Large Pack)."},{"name":"Skull Garland String – 10ft","slug":"skull-garland-string-10ft","description":"Create a spooky Halloween atmosphere with the Skull Garland String – 10ft. This creepy decorative garland features multiple realistic skulls attached along a long 10ft string, making it perfect for Halloween parties, haunted houses, horror-themed events, and festive decorations. Its lightweight and durable design allows easy hanging on walls, doors, ceilings, staircases, windows, gardens, or party backdrops. The detailed skull design adds a scary and eye-catching effect to any setup, instantly transforming your space into a haunted scene. Ideal for both indoor and outdoor use, this reusable Halloween garland is perfect for homes, cafés, shops, events, and spooky photo booths.","price":7.99,"compareAtPrice":10.99,"currency":"USD","categorySlug":"home-decoration","images":["https://halloweenready.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Untitled-design-15.png"],"inventory":200,"tags":["Halloween Skeleton","Skull Garland"],"seoTitle":"Skull Garland String – 10ft","seoDescription":"Create a spooky Halloween atmosphere with the Skull Garland String – 10ft."},{"name":"Hanging Skeleton – 5ft Life Size","slug":"hanging-skeleton-5ft-life-size","description":"Bring spooky Halloween vibes to your party décor with the Hanging Skeleton – 5ft Life Size. Designed with realistic bone detailing and a full-size human skeleton look, this hanging decoration is perfect for haunted houses, Halloween parties, horror-themed events, and spooky room setups. Made from lightweight yet durable material, it can be easily hung on doors, walls, ceilings, trees, or entryways to create a terrifying atmosphere instantly.","price":21.99,"compareAtPrice":23.99,"currency":"USD","categorySlug":"home-decoration","images":["https://halloweenready.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Devil-Horns-Tail-Set-950-x-600-px-1.png"],"inventory":200,"tags":["Halloween Skeleton","Hanging Skeleton"],"seoTitle":"Hanging Skeleton – 5ft Life Size","seoDescription":"Bring spooky Halloween vibes to your party décor with the Hanging Skeleton – 5ft Life Size."},{"name":"3D PVC Bat Wall Stickers (Set of 12)","slug":"3d-pvc-bat-wall-stickers-set-of-12","description":"This 3D PVC Bat Wall Stickers (Set of 12) comes with spooky and realistic bat designs, making it perfect for Halloween decoration and themed parties. Whether you are decorating your home, office, classroom, or party space, these stylish bat stickers create a creepy and fun atmosphere that instantly enhances your Halloween setup. The lightweight and durable PVC material makes these wall stickers easy to apply and remove without damaging surfaces. Ideal for walls, doors, windows, and photo backdrops, this Halloween decoration set beautifully combines spooky vibes, creativity, and festive charm in one stylish package — making your celebration look more exciting and memorable.","price":4.99,"compareAtPrice":8,"currency":"USD","categorySlug":"home-decoration","images":["https://halloweenready.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/imgi_55_61NF5mMYP7L._SL1500_.png"],"inventory":200,"tags":["3D Wall Stickers","Halloween Bat Stickers"],"seoTitle":"3D PVC Bat Wall Stickers (Set of 12)","seoDescription":"This 3D PVC Bat Wall Stickers (Set of 12) comes with spooky and realistic bat designs, making it perfect for Halloween decoration and themed parties."}]}]}]
